# Clean Article About Agent Reading

Agent readers work best when the page has a clear article root, useful headings, and focused paragraphs.

This fixture keeps navigation and decoration out of the body so the renderer can produce stable markdown.

## Readable Structure

The article includes a short section with a related guide and a direct citation target.

> Stable extraction is easier when meaningful content is grouped under headings.

The final paragraph gives the reader enough body text to avoid weak article scoring.


